      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried this CA option with the previous snap. It rendered the PEM inline in the backend .conf, and Oslo Config rejected the file. Can we make the snap-first upgrade requirement explicit here and prevent applying the option against an older snap?\n\nhttps://github.com/canonical/snap-cinder-volume/blob/2d413f04352c414927b827a61965c7881429eee8/cinder_volume/templates/backend.conf.j2#L4",
      "revId": "b71c2a0d94187d97b6bae675b736d6d69fa27337",
