      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T21:19:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The charm accepts pure-trisync-enabled and emits a single replication device here. Cinder requires two devices for TriSync and logs an error when it receives one. Could we reject that combination before deployment so the operator gets a clear answer about what will be enabled?\n\nhttps://opendev.org/openstack/cinder/src/commit/58f7ac750dba3648d0f5c8517dba5e8f529f26cd/cinder/volume/drivers/pure.py#L629",
      "revId": "b71c2a0d94187d97b6bae675b736d6d69fa27337",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b5859276_e79618ca",
